### 1. Submit a credit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "TXN-1001",
  "requestId": "REQ-1001",
  "accountId": "ACC-201",
  "transactionType": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "sequenceNumber": 1
}

### 2. Trigger background processing immediately
POST http://localhost:8080/api/processor/run

### 3. Inspect transaction and balance
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/TXN-1001
GET http://localhost:8080/api/balances
GET http://localhost:8080/api/summary

### 4. Submit a transient failure (fails once, succeeds on next run)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "TXN-2001",
  "requestId": "REQ-2001",
  "accountId": "ACC-202",
  "transactionType": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 25.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "sequenceNumber": 1,
  "simulateTransientFailure": true
}

### 5. Inspect duplicate audit and sequence gaps
GET http://localhost:8080/api/duplicates
GET http://localhost:8080/api/processor/pending-gaps
